WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:03.236
[music playing]

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.917
Up there is pure energy
in its rawest form.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:20.587
It's exactly what I need.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.489
[sighing]

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.823
[grunting]

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:29.229
Wild honey-- a nutritious
calorie-packed hit of energy.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.133
It's pretty special stuff.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.505
But getting it is never easy.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.840
[screaming]

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.310
I'm getting stung all over.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:48.581
I just keep getting
nailed by bees.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:57.791
My plan is simple.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:01.795
I'm using this rope ladder I've
made so I can position myself

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.263
right next to the entrance.

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:06.966
I can hear them buzzing.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.835
That is the landing
pad for the thousands

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:14.207
of bees that live inside
this tree where the honey is.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:17.310
Cutting into here means I
won't damage the hive above.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.077
Oh, yeah.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:18.978
They're coming.

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:19.946
You see them?

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:21.080
They know I'm here.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:27.687
Oh, yeah they're coming out now.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.956
But this wood is like concrete.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:33.827
I'm just aggravating the bees.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:37.397
I have to try
something different.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:39.365
[grunting]

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.101
[screaming]

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.038
[spitting]

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:47.774
They're coming out in force.

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.275
I just have to reach inside.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.947
Ugh.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.081
My eyelids.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.987
Just a few sticky
handfuls are enough.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:02.388
[grunting]

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:03.690
Yeah.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:04.691
[sputtering]

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.326
Time to get out of here.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:10.697
[screams]

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:14.734
[grunting]

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.682
Another day in the jungle.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:30.984
Yeah.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.019
They're still
everywhere my hair.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.926
Pain is a price worth paying.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:42.195
This could be my
only food for days.

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:47.233
So good.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.068
Mm.

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:51.738
Pure honey-- straight
from the hive.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:52.639
This is amazing.

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:56.175
[music playing]

